─────────────────────────    ──────────────────────────────────
Collectors.toList()          stream().toList()
     │                              │
     ▼                              ▼
ArrayList (mutable) ✅      ImmutableCollections$ListN ❌
     │                              │
     ▼                              ▼
Hibernate clear() → OK      Hibernate clear() → 💥 CRASH

