Spring BootQuarkusFile mặc địnhapplication.yml / .propertiesapplication.propertiesYAML supportBuilt-inExtension quarkus-config-yamlInject value@Value(&quot;${key}&quot;)@ConfigProperty(name = &quot;key&quot;)Config class@ConfigurationProperties@ConfigMappingProfilesapplication-dev.yml (file riêng)%dev.key=value (cùng file!)Runtime override-Dkey=value-Dkey=value (giống)Env varMY_APP_PORT=8080MY_APP_PORT=8080 (giống)

